 "remarks": "Welcome to this move-in-ready end-unit townhouse in Norwalk's convenient Brookside neighborhood! Offering over 2,400 square feet of living space across three finished levels, this 3-bedroom, 3.5-bath home delivers a wonderful blend of comfort, style and easy living. Natural light pours through the windows, highlighting an open, airy floor plan with hardwood floors and effortless flow for everyday living and entertaining. The spacious kitchen features granite countertops, stainless steel appliances and a center island, with sliding doors opening to a generous, sun-filled deck. Upstairs, the inviting primary suite features a vaulted ceiling, oversized window, walk-in closet and spacious bath complete with a soaking tub, separate shower and double vanity. Two additional bedrooms and a full hall bath complete the second level. The finished walk-out lower level offers incredible flexibility for recreation, a home office, fitness space or additional living area, complete with a full bath. Main-level laundry and an attached garage add to the home's appeal. Ideally situated near local schools and within easy reach of Rowayton, Darien and vibrant SoNo, with easy access to shopping, restaurants, Metro-North Train, I-95, parks and beaches. Turnkey, spacious and perfectly positioned to enjoy the best of Fairfield County living!",
